ry (λmax = 267 nm). According to the law of mass conservation, the drug concentration of corresponding 1-octanol phase and the lipo-hydro partition coefficientPo/w (Po/w = Co/Cw =Ao/Aw, where A stands for absorbance) were calculated."}]}